    <paragraphs>
        <title>Prediction vs Inference</title>

        <paragraphs>
            <title>Prediction</title>

            <sidebyside width="40%">
                <stack>
                    <p>
                        Given a value <m>X</m>, try to provide an estimate for
                        <m>f(X)</m>.
                    </p>

                    <p>
                        Build a model
                        <md>
                            \hat Y = \hat f (X)
                        </md>
                    </p>

                    <ul component="instructor-notes">
                        <li>
                            <p>
                                Want to get a good guess for $f$, which is
                                unknown blue
                            </p>
                        </li>

                        <li>
                            <p>
                                Model is <m>\hat f</m> is green dashed lines
                            </p>
                        </li>
                    </ul>
                </stack>

                <stack>
                    <p>
                        Example: If we spend $250 on TV advertising, what do we
                        predict we will we make in sales?
                    </p>

                    <image source="figures/Fig2-1-WithHatF-TV.png">
                        <shortdescription>
                            Sales versus TV advertising spending in units of
                            1000 along with two different linear fits
                        </shortdescription>
                    </image>
                </stack>
            </sidebyside>
        </paragraphs>
    </paragraphs>
    <!-- <exercises xml:id="exercises-day02-GW1"> -->
    <!-- <exercisegroup> -->
    <!-- <title>Group Work</title> -->
    <introduction>
        <p>
            The blue solid line is <m>f</m>.
            The green dashed line is <m>\hat f</m>.
            What is the predicted sales for the first three data points using
            the green dashed line <m>\hat f</m> shown in the graph?
            Note all values are approximate.
        </p>
    </introduction>

